                    Repeated to COMUSMACV.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f2" n="2" xml:id="d137-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d111-f4">footnote 4, Document 111</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d137-f3" n="3" xml:id="d137-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram DEF 928115 to CINCPAC, May 16,
                    indicated that the programming level and source of funding for fiscal year 1964
                    for ammunition for the Republic of Vietnam would be included in a forthcoming
                    general guidance. (Washington National Records Center, RG 319, U.S. Army Message Center Microfilm, Reel 11328)</p>
            </note>
